  "details": "Users from Asia when joining EU instances,we get kicked out with an error saying \"Your connection to VRChat timed out. Verify connection and try again.\". \n\nSometimes it does it for a few times before letting you join the instance, sometimes it doesn't let you at ALL, the user gets stuck in the place where players spawn, before you can properly spawn into the world. The user can't bring up their menu at all, force closing the game is the only option.\n\nAnd even when the users can finally join the instance, the audio of everyone else keeps getting cut off, its severe enough to the point where we can't understand what they are saying. \n\nThe last time I joined an EU instance for an event, it took over an hour and a half to be able to join the instance(constant time outs), and when i could join it took another hour for the audio to start stabilising.",
